"""Palindrome ⭐

Check whether a word is a palindrome.

Example:

Enter word: madam
Palindrome

Another:

Enter word: python
Not a palindrome

Hint: Use slicing.

word[::-1]"""
text=input("enter text to whether its palindrome or not")
if text == text[::-1]:
  print("it's palindrome")
else:
  print("not palindrome")
